## Exact arithmetic model

All complex rectangles have integer endpoints divided by S=2^128. Addition
is exact. Multiplication encloses real and imaginary bilinear expressions by
their four corner products, followed by floor/ceiling division by S. Exact
Gaussian-rational left coefficients use a common positive denominator, exact
integer accumulation, then one outward division. Signed integer multiplication
swaps endpoints when negative. Horner evaluation at 1/8 uses outward division.
No Python float, NumPy, SciPy, numerical inverse, or SVD is used.

For one slot and x=k/8, write A(z)=-i[K+a psi(x+z)P] and E(z)=-i psi(x+z)P,
psi(s)=16s^2(1-s)^2. The exact Taylor coefficients are

    psi_k = [16x^2(1-x)^2, 32x(1-x)(1-2x),
             16-96x+96x^2, -32+64x, 16].

The augmented fundamental matrix is [[U,D],[0,U]], for B=[[A,E],[0,A]].
u_0=I,d_0=0 and

    (n+1)u_(n+1)=sum_(k=0)^min(4,n) A_k u_(n-k),
    (n+1)d_(n+1)=sum_(k=0)^min(4,n) [A_k d_(n-k)+E_k u_(n-k)].

The code encloses the coefficients through degree 80 and the exact truncated
polynomial value at h=1/8. It composes eight steps per slot and 24 slots,
retaining chronological matrix order. For each selected amplitude only its
own slot has a nonzero D block; caching other slot derivatives does not insert
them into that amplitude's product.

## Analytic error independent of arithmetic enclosure

At nominal a<=1, ||K||=3, ||P||=2 and 0<=x<=1. A coefficient majorant for B is
b(z)=7+32z+64z^2+128z^3+64z^4. These follow from |psi_0|<=1,
|psi_1|<=8, |psi_2|<=16, |psi_3|<=32, |psi_4|=16 and the block norm bound
||B_k||<=||A_k||+||E_k||. At R=1/4,
integral_0^R b(z)dz=773/240<4. The nonnegative scalar solution
f(z)=exp(integral_0^z b) majorizes all matrix Taylor coefficients in norm.
Since e<3, f(R)<81. Thus the degree-80 tail at h=R/2 is at most

    delta = 81 / 2^81.

For one selected global amplitude the exact augmented propagator over ANY
contiguous time segment has norm <=1+c<3, c=||P|| integral_0^1 psi=16/15.
Let E_n be the operator error in a product of n truncated steps. Exact suffix
telescoping gives E_n <=3 delta sum_(k=0)^(n-1)(3+E_k), hence
E_n<=9 n delta exp(3 n delta). For n<=192, 3n delta<1/2 and exp(3n delta)<2,
so E_n<=3456 delta<4096 delta=:e. The same bound holds for the U and D blocks.
The code's regrouped pulse/prefix/suffix calculation encloses the exact same
truncated product, so interval rounding is an additional enclosure, not an
unpriced physical error.

For H_j=-i U^dagger D_j, the exact/truncated difference is bounded by
e(c+e)+e<4e. Each Pauli coefficient Tr(P_mu H_j)/4 has absolute error at most
that norm. Therefore pad each real coefficient interval by

    e_A=4e=16384 delta=81/2^67.

The code retains the raw complex coordinates before the pad. The actual
Jacobian is real by unitarity. Its exact identity-coordinate derivative is
-integral psi Tr(P)/4=-8/15; containment is an additional sign/scalar check.

